{"v":4,"catch":"把世界掌握在自己手中！\n正宗，逼真的排球！","desc":"《Super Volleyball》是 VIDEO SYSTEM 於 1989 年推出的一款體育遊戲。\n儘管控制簡單，但它具有延遲攻擊和反向攻擊等技術，可用於高水平的來回比賽。\n一個真正捕捉排球樂趣的標題。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-08-25","genres":["運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4802f6bf10a5e2e1c91a8fcdf4f7d960f3b4763ded74c258ee36349321026a74.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/40a857861ea568562e911ed7d937c20e6df1fe9e3ce315d2d46162797fdaa6ea.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7b8a865f68def2037b276b4998cea4889bacdc0344cb6c6b5975de243edbbd92.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/17a7feb7818bf736aef7759baf1325807fbda032e9e878a0d0b98f6779d65a2f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2fe7141307a1955d504729b309dae0a75b6125ee119efdb51e245e685ceb6f87.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5234bdca2b07682fe94bbe9b962c57d37e444d6ca74bb7dc0a5c582f6cd39ec9.jpg"],"titleId":"010082d01854e000","dlc":[]}